dwm 6.8, patched. -v prints version.

Patches
-------
On top of vanilla dwm 6.8. Diffs in patches-6.8/.

 fixborders        opaque borders under a compositor
 alwayscenter      floating windows open centered
 restartsig        restart action; SIGHUP/SIGTERM handling, see Signals
 moveresize        move/resize floating windows from the keyboard
 focusonclick      focus on click, not hover
 hide_vacant_tags  empty tags hidden from the bar
 monocle_count     monocle shows [position/total] in the bar
 movestack         swap focused client with next/previous in the stack
 fullgaps          uniform, adjustable gaps between tiled windows
 fibonacci         spiral and dwindle layouts; gap-aware
 pertag            layout/mfact/nmaster/bar remembered per tag
 scratchpad        floating scratchpad terminal, toggled in and out
 swallow           a terminal's window is swallowed by a GUI program it
                   spawns, restored on exit
 swaptags          swap current tag's clients with another tag's
 volbright-keys    XF86 keys -> amixer / brightnessctl (not a suckless.org
                   patch)
 attachaside       new clients attach beside same-tag clients instead of
                   becoming master

Keybinds
--------
Match stock dwm defaults. A couple of keys are bound twice, once per
keysym, because which physical key is unshifted depends on the active
keyboard layout - marked US/ES below.

 Mod1-p                          spawn dmenu
 Mod1-Shift-Return               spawn terminal
 Mod1-grave / Mod1-masculine (US/ES)   toggle scratchpad terminal
 Mod1-b                          toggle bar
 Mod1-j / Mod1-k                 focus next / previous window
 Mod1-i / Mod1-d                 increase / decrease master area windows
 Mod1-l / Mod1-h                 increase / decrease master area size
 Mod1-Shift-j / Mod1-Shift-k     swap focused client with next / previous
                                  in stack
 Mod1-Return                     zoom focused window to/from master
 Mod1-Tab                        toggle previously selected tags
 Mod1-Shift-c                    close focused window
 Mod1-t / f / m / r / Shift-r    set layout: tiled / floating / monocle /
                                  spiral / dwindle
 Mod1-space                      toggle current/previous layout
 Mod1-Shift-space                toggle focused window floating/tiled
 Mod1-Arrows                     move focused floating window
 Mod1-Shift-Arrows               resize focused floating window
 Mod1-Control-Arrows             snap focused floating window to edge
 Mod1-Control-Shift-Arrows       stretch focused floating window to edge
 Mod1-0 / Mod1-Shift-0           view / apply all tags
 Mod1-, / Mod1-.                 focus previous / next monitor
 Mod1-Shift-, / Mod1-Shift-.     send focused window to prev / next monitor
 Mod1-minus                      decrease gaps
 Mod1-plus / Mod1-equal (US/ES)  increase gaps
 Mod1-[1-9]                      view nth tag
 Mod1-Control-[1-9]              toggle nth tag in view
 Mod1-Shift-[1-9]                apply nth tag to focused window
 Mod1-Control-Shift-[1-9]        toggle nth tag on focused window
 Mod4-Shift-[1-9]                swap current tag's clients with nth tag's
 Mod1-Shift-q                    quit
 Mod1-Control-Shift-q            restart
 XF86AudioRaiseVolume/Lower/Mute volume up/down/mute, via amixer
 XF86MonBrightnessUp/Down        brightness up/down, via brightnessctl

Mouse
-----
 tag number: click / right-click            view tag / toggle into view
 tag number: Mod1-click / Mod1-right-click  send window to tag / toggle
                                              tag on window
 layout symbol: click / right-click         toggle layout / jump to
                                              monocle
 window title: middle-click                 zoom focused window to master
 status text: middle-click                  spawn terminal
 on a window: Mod1-drag                     move (floats it first)
 on a window: Mod1-middle-click             toggle floating
 on a window: Mod1-Button3-drag             resize (floating)

Status text: read from the root window name; set with xsetroot(1).

Signals: SIGHUP restarts, SIGTERM quits cleanly.

Repo layout: patches/ = originals as sourced, reference only.
patches-6.8/ = one diff per patch above, in order; apply 01->16 in
sequence, not standalone. Upgrade: rebase this branch onto a new dwm
tag, fix conflicts one at a time.

Build
-----
    make clean install

Needs Xlib headers; swallow also needs libxcb + xcb-res. Add
`exec dwm` to .xinitrc. Edit config.h directly, then `make`.

See also: dmenu(1), st(1), amixer(1), brightnessctl(1)
Bugs: https://github.com/loothmarleck/dwm
